sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant SenderScreen
    participant SecurityLifecycleMixin
    participant FilePicker as FilePicker (file_picker)

    User->>SenderScreen: tap "Choose File" (Step 1)
    SenderScreen->>SenderScreen: _pickFile()
    SenderScreen->>SecurityLifecycleMixin: _wipeSensitiveData()
    Note right of SecurityLifecycleMixin: zero any previous _aesKey, _iv,<br/>_encryptedBytes, clear _encryptedAESKey,<br/>wipeAll() on registry

    SenderScreen->>FilePicker: pickFiles(withData: kIsWeb)
    alt Web
        FilePicker-->>SenderScreen: PlatformFile { name, size, bytes }
    else Mobile / Desktop
        FilePicker-->>SenderScreen: PlatformFile { name, size, path }
    end

    SenderScreen->>SenderScreen: store result as _file
    SenderScreen-->>User: advance to Step 2 (Encrypt File)
    Note right of SenderScreen: _encryptedBytes, _aesKey, _iv,<br/>_encryptedAESKey all null/cleared
